  "longBusinessSummary": "B+S Banksysteme Aktiengesellschaft provides software solutions for banks and financial service providers. It offers software solutions in the areas of mobile and online banking; payment transactions; documentary transactions for import and export of letter of credit and collection, and guarantees; and treasury trading products, including foreign exchange spot and swap position, and interest rate positions, as well as liquidity-oriented position presentation. The company also provides foreign currency and precious metal trading services; core banking services, such as checking and current accounts, fixed-term deposits, and investment and foreign currency accounts; and risk management services comprising credit and default, advance payment, market price, and liquidity risks. In addition, it offers banking APIs, such as XS2A, EBICS, HBCI/FinTS, and web scrapping services; account information, payment initiation, and securities services; credit cards, points accounts, and payment providers and fintechs; B+S shield service; and reporting for account information and payment initiation services and anti-money laundering and counter terrorism for account information and payment initiation services, as well as software as a service, license as a service, and banking as a service solutions. B+S Banksysteme Aktiengesellschaft was founded in 1982 and is headquartered in Munich, Germany.",
